Cell["\<\
The resource function allows using any distinct expression for axis indices; \
\[LineSeparator]by not parsing a string and building an AST oneself, the DSL \
can be easily extended due to the inherent expressiveness of WL.\
\>", "Text",
ExpressionUUID->"beb8ded8-b7f1-cf46-bba6-e19d6e45c040"],

