 "s a release asset?\[LineSeparator]Of course,  even then it could only \
really happen with observable CI/CD and immutable releases in place."
}], "Text",
ExpressionUUID->"5a0e2d9e-7528-a44d-b53b-a8774e6b887a"],

Cell["\<\
I\[CloseCurlyQuote]m especially interested in feedback from experienced \
Wolfram users on the interface:\
\>", "Text",
ExpressionUUID->"c790e3c2-f0d8-2a41-8b02-753f5a24b9d0"],

Cell["\<\
Does this feel natural, or too foreign despite being made of native WL \
expressions?\
\>", "Item",
ExpressionUUID->"e4ccbd18-a613-2447-a3a6-91ecd1364f95"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Are ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["CircleTimes", TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "370c177a-152f-6041-923f-9694cbc6c17e"],
 " / ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["CirclePlus", TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "238149a7-e7e3-7b46-b809-a17330b8daa3"],
 " reasonable choices for product and direct-sum axes?"
}], "Item",
ExpressionUUID->"055316e1-4df9-9443-8145-a6a6306b2a48"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Are ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"Highlighted", "[", "...", "]"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "cf3e478b-60f1-5a44-91d8-d3cdd727fb6e"],
 " / ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"Framed", "[", "...", "]"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "780b6a71-e462-124c-8b75-5bb4c4aa3cc1"],
 " acceptable as targeting syntax, or too visually/semantically odd?"
}], "Item",
ExpressionUUID->"3d61964b-2145-6048-af51-b05caeeb71a2"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "I\[CloseCurlyQuote]ve allowed ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"Slot", "[", "...", "]"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "fd56d94c-4454-2149-ab62-48b26b7c297f"],
 " as a shorthand for targeting as well, which technically abuses WL syntax \
(and right now breaks static checking);\[LineSeparator]should I drop it?"
}], "Item",
ExpressionUUID->"cfd886de-7a91-0c45-acac-458283fc02d4"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Would you expect this kind of project to live primarily as a paclet, a ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["ResourceFunction", TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "f020eeb3-9cee-7e4c-981e-59fa67f1db0e"],
 ", or both?\nAre there built-in conventions I am accidentally fighting?"
}], "Item",
ExpressionUUID->"3bf03cc1-2443-3945-90d6-d399dadaf66c"],

Cell["\<\
I would be grateful for API/design feedback before trying to polish this \
further for wider release,\[LineSeparator]and any thoughts or comments are \
much obliged \[HappySmiley]\
\>", "Text",
ExpressionUUID->"ff24b649-56de-5149-abce-7e25aa13f0d3"]
}, Open  ]]
},
